+## #1122 - The multi-axis page family draws through the form seam
+
+**What was decided.**
+- The multi-axis family is `multiaxis_page.rs`, `rotary_page.rs` and
+  `multiaxis_deburr_page.rs`. The setup rotary and axis pick pages
+  (`setup_rotary_page.rs`, `setup_axis_pick.rs`, `stock_axis_rows.rs`) are
+  in the setup and fixtures family. `machine_axis_chain.rs` is in the
+  tools and machine family.
+- The one raw call left in the family, the read-only "Always on" value of
+  the multi-axis deburr page's "Shank and holder guard" row, uses
+  `list_row`. It paints the same text.
+- The raw-call guard (`layout/form_seam_tests.rs`) gets a `multi-axis`
+  family at 0.
+- The branch is stacked on the turning slice (PR #4218): the two slices
+  change the same guard rows.
+
+**Why.** One seam for rows and fields lets a look restyle every page at
+once (#655).
+
+**Considered and dropped.**
+- Add a value-text helper (`value_row`) for read-only values. `list_row`
+  already is the seam's read-only text, and one call site does not need a
+  second helper.
+- Put this family into the turning PR. The issue asks for one PR for each
+  family.
+
+**Cost to change later.** Small: one call site and one guard row.

From b852d725732a0d5d955ebbd3e62ed8bea38c4072 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:40:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] refactor(ui): the 2D and 3D pages draw through the form
 seam

The 2D family (2D milling, cutting and the editors they share) loses
its raw egui calls: new seam helpers button_enabled,
small_button_enabled, checkbox, list_row_truncated, note, drag_row and
drag_sized_row draw what the raw calls drew. The number and text fields
that move to drag_row, int_range_row and text_row now join the pane's
Tab / Enter ring and carry their row's accessible name.

The raw-call guard gets the 2D and 3D families at zero, and it counts a
call that is split after `ui` over two lines.

Stacked on the multi-axis slice (#4220): all change the guard rows.

Pinned by pages_do_not_add_raw_egui_calls_outside_the_form_seam,
form_seam_guard_covers_only_the_migrated_families,
the_guard_counts_a_raw_call_split_over_two_lines and
the_2d_seam_helpers_keep_clicks_text_and_names.

Refs #1122

